.TH _PRINTF 3 "April 2026" "Holberton School" "User Manual"
.SH NAME
_printf \- custom implementation of printf
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include \(dqmain.h\(dq
.br
.B int _printf(const char *format, ...);
.SH DESCRIPTION
_printf writes output to stdout according to a format string.
The format string is composed of zero or more directives.
.PP
The following conversion specifiers are supported:
.TP
.B %c
Prints a single character.
.TP
.B %s
Prints a string. If the argument is NULL, prints (null).
.TP
.B %%
Prints a literal percent sign.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the number of characters printed, excluding the null byte.
.br
Returns \-1 if format is NULL.
.SH SEE ALSO
printf(3)
.SH BUGS
No known bugs.
